      "writtenOn": "2019-11-13T16:57:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I suggest you to have a rule to unzip the srcjar into \u003csnapshot-root\u003e/stub-srcs/\u003cdroiddoc_module_name\u003e (directory structure is just an example). The rule of course should clear the directory before unzipping. \n\nIn the Android.bp side, you can have a filegroup like this\n\nfilegroup {\n    name: \"mydroidstub_\u003csdkname\u003e@\u003cver\u003e\",\n    srcs: [\"stub-srcs/mydroidstub/**/*.java\"],\n}\n\nsdk_snapshot {\n    name: ...,\n    droidstub_srcs: [\"mydroidstub_\u003csdkname\u003e@ver\", ...],\n}\n\n\nand then the entire \u003csnapshot-root\u003e is zipped.",
      "parentUuid": "58cfb485_6814b327",
      "revId": "c1ff97e2c6e3e8bf84235bfe4ded0692e9a23c93",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
    },
